Cell["\<\
{((omega_n)^2*(-1 - 2*(omega_n1) + 2*(omega_n1)^2))/(2 + 4*(omega_n)*(1 + \
(omega_n1))), 
 (1 + 2*(omega_n)*(1 + (omega_n1)) + (omega_n)^2*(1 + 2*(omega_n1) - \
2*(omega_n1)^2))/(2 + 4*(omega_n)*(1 + (omega_n1))), -3/2, 1}\
\>", "Output",
